OL,11,G0000FDance Sounds of the 90s with
OL,12,     FVernon Kay
OL,13,     GIn the 90s, 'Carpet Clubs' were
OL,14,     Gvenues with a sticky floor, cheap
OL,15,     Gdrinks, a decent sound system and
